		(property "DesignNote" "VBACK super kapasitoru; BQ32000 trickle charge ile sarj. Yedek ~22 gun (1.5F, 3.3V->1.4V, 1.5uA); kacak akim olculmeli. Reflow yapilmaz, elle lehim."
			(at 257.81 60.96 0)
			(hide yes)
